\pard\plain \s61\li360\sa60\sb30\qj\widctlpar\qj\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Apply post-processing to an already-imported scene.\par
This is strictly equivalent to calling {\b aiImportFile()}/{\b aiImportFileEx} with the same flags. However, you can use this separate function to inspect the imported scene first to fine-tune your post-processing setup. {\par
{\s5\sb90\sa30\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs16\cgrid 
